            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.91

- Fixed album covers sometimes staying blank for a whole song. Two separate pieces of cover loading shared one cancel switch, so each could abort the other's download.
- A cover that is already downloading is now left to finish rather than being restarted.
]]></description>
