            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.90

- An empty cover tile now retries straight away instead of waiting, so a missing album cover fills in as soon as it can.
- Added a diagnostic that records why a cover was left blank, to track down a rare case where it stays empty for a whole song.
]]></description>
