            <sparkle:version>196</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.89</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.89

- Now uses much less energy while music is playing, and should no longer appear in macOS's significant-energy list. It was checking the player far more often than it needed to; progress and lyrics were never driven by those checks.
- Cleaned up stray temporary files left behind if Now was force-quit.
]]></description>
